# The only thing a self-hoster has to configure: which RCQ island this build
# talks to. Copy to `.env.local` and point it at your own server.
#
# Used for the REST API and, derived from it, the wss://…/ws socket. Unset it
# and the build talks to https://api.rcq.app.
VITE_API_BASE=https://your-rcq-server.example
